enerated randomness with a human-readable transcription.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference says computer-generated randomness, not determinism.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-012\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"It is not a way to process user-created sentences (also known as brainwallets) into a wallet seed.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The claim matches apart from a typo in 'seed', which does not change its meaning.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-013\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"user-created sentences (also known as brainwallets)\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states user-created sentences are also known as brainwallets.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-001\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"The mnemonic must encode entropy in a multiple of 32 bits.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference gives a multiple of 32 bits, not 23 bits.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-002\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"More entropy improves security\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states that more entropy improves security.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-003\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"but increases the sentence length\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states that more entropy increases the sentence length.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The initial entropy length is referred to as ENT.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-005\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"The allowed size of ENT is 128-256 bits.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference gives 128-256 bits, not 1024-2048 bytes.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-006\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"First, an initial entropy of ENT bits is generated.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The ref